t-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">From the coast of Central Vietnam to celebrations around the world, we follow stories wherever they take us.</p></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><a class=\"group block border-t border-[#d8d3ca] py-16 md:py-24\" href=\"/destinations/da-nang\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">01<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->Central Vietnam</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-5xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl\">Da Nang</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">A coastal city where modern celebrations meet beaches, mountains, and quiet moments.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50\">Explore →</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"></div></div></div></a><a class=\"group block border-t border-[#d8d3ca] py-16 md:py-24\" href=\"/destinations/hoi-an\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">02<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->Central Vietnam</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-5xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl\">Hoi An</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">Ancient streets, warm light, intimate venues, and a timeless atmosphere.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50\">Explore →</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"></div></div></div></a><a class=\"group block border-t border-[#d8d3ca] py-16 md:py-24\" href=\"/destinations/con-dao\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">03<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->Vietnam</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-5xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl\">Côn Đảo</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">An intimate island destination surrounded by untouched beaches and natural beauty.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50\">Explore →</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"></div></div></div></a><a class=\"group block border-t border-[#d8d3ca] py-16 md:py-24\" href=\"/destinations/ba-na-hills\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">04<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <!-- -->Da Nang · Vietnam</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-5xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-7xl\">Ba Na Hills</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">A mountain destination above the clouds, surrounded by dramatic landscapes.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50\">Explore →</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"></div></div></div></a></div></section><footer class=\"bg-[#171717] px-6 py-16 text-[#f7f5f0] md:px-10 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-6\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">The Scene Studio</p><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md font-serif text-4xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-6xl\">Stories worth remembering.</p><p class=\"mt-8 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93]\">Da Nang · Vietnam</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#9d9a93]\">Explore</p><nav class=\"mt-6 flex